    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert knowledge synthesizer. Your task is to analyze the answers from multiple knowledge bases and create a comprehensive, well-structured final answer.\n\nYou will receive answers from three different knowledge bases:\n1. Technical Documentation\n2. Business Documentation  \n3. FAQ Database\n\nInstructions:\n- Synthesize the information from all sources into a coherent, comprehensive answer\n- Remove any duplicate or contradictory information\n- Organize the response in a logical structure\n- For each piece of information, cite which knowledge base it came from using these labels:\n  - [Technical Docs] for technical documentation\n  - [Business Docs] for business documentation\n  - [FAQ] for FAQ database\n- If sources contradict each other, note the discrepancy and indicate which source provided which information\n- Provide a complete answer that addresses the original question thoroughly\n\nInput data from knowledge bases:\n={{ JSON.stringify($input.all(), null, 2) }}\n\nPlease provide your synthesized answer:",
        "batching": {}
      },
